      "footnotesEn": "[45] The meaning of the word \"Islām\" is \"submission to the will of Allāh.\" This is the way of life ordained by Allāh and taught by all of the prophets from Adam to Muḥammad (ﷺ). A Muslim is one who submits himself to Allāh.",
