      "arTajweed": "إِ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>مَا حَرَّمَ عَلَيْكُمُ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَيْتَةَ وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span>دَّمَ وَلَحْمَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخِ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نزِ</span>يرِ وَمَ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">آ</span> أُهِلَّ بِهِ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۦ</span> لِغَيْرِ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ فَمَنِ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>ضْطُرَّ غَيْرَ بَاغ<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٍ وَ</span>لَا عَاد<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ٍ فَ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">آ</span> إِثْمَ عَلَيْهِ إِ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ غَفُور<span class=\"tj-idgham-wo-ghunnah\">ٌ رَّ</span>حِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ي</span>مٌ"
