      "arTajweed": "زُيِّنَ لِلَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span> <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَيَ<span class=\"tj-slnt\">و</span><span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>ةُ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْيَا وَيَسْخَرُونَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span> وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّقَوْ<span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span> فَوْقَهُمْ يَوْمَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقِيَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>مَةِ وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ يَرْزُقُ مَ<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ن يَ</span>شَ<span class=\"tj-madda-obligatory\">آ</span>ءُ بِغَيْرِ حِسَ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ا</span><span class=\"tj-qalaqah\">ب</span>ٍ"
