      "arTajweed": "فَإِ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ن طَ</span>لَّقَهَا فَلَا تَحِلُّ لَهُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> مِن<span class=\"tj-iqlab\">ۢ ب</span>َعْدُ حَتَّىٰ تَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نكِ</span>حَ زَوْجًا غَيْرَهُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> فَإِ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ن طَ</span>لَّقَهَا فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْهِمَ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">آ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ن يَ</span>تَرَاجَعَ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">آ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ن ظَ</span><span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span><span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">آ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ن يُ</span>قِيمَا حُدُودَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَتِلْكَ حُدُودُ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ يُبَيِّنُهَا لِقَوْم<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٍ يَ</span>عْلَمُ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">و</span>نَ"
