      "arTajweed": "وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ يُتَوَفَّوْنَ مِ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نكُ</span>مْ وَيَذَرُونَ أَزْوَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>ج<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ًا يَ</span>تَرَبَّصْنَ بِأَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نفُ</span>سِهِ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> أَرْبَعَةَ أَشْهُر<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٍ وَ</span>عَشْر<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ًا فَ</span>إِذَا بَلَغْنَ أَجَلَهُ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ فِيمَا فَعَلْنَ فِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نفُ</span>سِهِ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> بِ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَعْرُوفِ وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ي</span>رٌ"
