      "arTajweed": "وَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ فِيمَا عَرَّضْتُ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa-shafawi\">م بِ</span>هِ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۦ</span> مِنْ خِ<span class=\"tj-qalaqah\">طْ</span>بَةِ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نِّ</span>سَ<span class=\"tj-madda-obligatory\">آ</span>ءِ أَوْ أَكْنَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نتُ</span>مْ فِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نفُ</span>سِكُمْ عَلِمَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ أَ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>كُمْ سَتَذْكُرُونَهُ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> وَلَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>كِ<span class=\"tj-idgham-wo-ghunnah\">ن لَّ</span>ا تُوَاعِدُوهُ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> سِرًّا إِلَّ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">آ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ن تَ</span>قُولُو<span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span> قَوْل<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ًا مَّ</span>عْرُوف<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ًا وَ</span>لَا تَعْزِمُو<span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span> عُ<span class=\"tj-qalaqah\">قْ</span>دَةَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نِّ</span>كَاحِ حَتَّىٰ يَ<span class=\"tj-qalaqah\">بْ</span>لُغَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>بُ أَجَلَهُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>عْلَمُ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">وٓ</span><span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يَعْلَمُ مَا فِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نفُ</span>سِكُمْ فَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>حْذَرُوهُ وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>عْلَمُ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">وٓ</span><span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ غَفُورٌ حَلِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ي</span>مٌ"
