      "arTajweed": "وَقَالَ لَهُمْ نَبِيُّهُمْ إِ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> ءَايَةَ مُلْكِهِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ۦٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ن يَ</span>أْتِيَكُمُ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span>تَّابُوتُ فِيهِ سَكِينَة<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٌ مِّ</span><span class=\"tj-idgham-wo-ghunnah\">ن رَّ</span>بِّكُمْ وَبَقِيَّة<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٌ مِّ</span><span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا تَرَكَ ءَالُ مُوسَىٰ وَءَالُ هَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>رُونَ تَحْمِلُهُ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَلَ<span class=\"tj-madda-obligatory\">ٰٓ</span>ئِكَةُ إِ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> فِى ذَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>لِكَ لَءَايَة<span class=\"tj-idgham-wo-ghunnah\">ً لَّ</span>كُمْ إِ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ن كُ</span><span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نتُ</span><span class=\"tj-idgham-shafawi\">م مُّ</span>ؤْمِنِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ي</span>نَ"
