      "arTajweed": "ٱللَّهُ لَ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">آ</span> إِلَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>هَ إِلَّا هُوَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَىُّ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَيُّومُ لَا تَأْخُذُهُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> سِنَة<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٌ وَ</span>لَا نَوْم<span class=\"tj-idgham-wo-ghunnah\">ٌ لَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> مَا فِى <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>وَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>تِ وَمَا فِى <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ مَ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ن ذَ</span>ا <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى يَشْفَعُ عِ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ندَ</span>هُ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ۥٓ</span> إِلَّا بِإِذْنِهِ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۦ</span> يَعْلَمُ مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَهُمْ وَلَا يُحِيطُونَ بِشَىْء<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٍ مِّ</span>نْ عِلْمِهِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ۦٓ</span> إِلَّا بِمَا شَ<span class=\"tj-madda-obligatory\">آ</span>ءَ وَسِعَ كُرْسِيُّهُ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>وَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ وَلَا يَـُٔودُهُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> حِفْظُهُمَا وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَلِىُّ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَظِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ي</span>مُ"
