      "arTajweed": "أَوْ كَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى مَرَّ عَلَىٰ قَرْيَة<span class=\"tj-idgham-ghunnah\">ٍ وَ</span>هِىَ خَاوِيَةٌ عَلَىٰ عُرُوشِهَا قَالَ أَ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ىٰ يُحْىِ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۦ</span> هَ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ٰ</span>ذِهِ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ بَعْدَ مَوْتِهَا فَأَمَاتَهُ <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ مِ<span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span>ئَةَ عَام<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ٍ ثُ</span><span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> بَعَثَهُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> قَالَ كَمْ لَبِثْتَ قَالَ لَبِثْتُ يَوْمًا أَوْ بَعْضَ يَوْم<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ٍ قَ</span>الَ بَل لَّبِثْتَ مِ<span class=\"tj-slnt\">ا۟</span>ئَةَ عَام<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ٍ فَ</span><span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نظُ</span>رْ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِكَ وَشَرَابِكَ لَمْ يَتَسَ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هْ وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نظُ</span>رْ إِلَىٰ حِمَارِكَ وَلِنَ<span class=\"tj-qalaqah\">جْ</span>عَلَكَ ءَايَة<span class=\"tj-idgham-wo-ghunnah\">ً لِّ</span><span class=\"tj-laam-shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>اسِ وَ<span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نظُ</span>رْ إِلَى <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعِظَامِ كَيْفَ نُ<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">نشِ</span>زُهَا ثُ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> نَكْسُوهَا لَحْم<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ًا فَ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا تَبَيَّنَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj-madda-normal\">ۥ</span> قَالَ أَعْلَمُ أَ<span class=\"tj-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tj-ham-wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْء<span class=\"tj-ikhafa\">ٍ قَ</span>دِ<span class=\"tj-madda-permissible\">ي</span>رٌ"
